# Daredevil, Man Without Fear. Haste, vigilance. Whenever Bot1 attacks it may exile the top card of its library; a Hero card
# makes Daredevil +2/+1 until end of turn, and the card may be played this turn. Turn 1: the Hero Agent Maria Hill is exiled,
# Daredevil is a 5/5 and Bot2 takes 5; the Hero is not cast (every Mox is tapped for Daredevil... Pearl is) and on turn 3 it is
# no longer playable. Turn 3: Lightning Bolt is exiled, no Hero, so Daredevil stays a 3/4 (Bot2 takes 3), and the Bolt is cast
# from exile that turn at Bot2 (3 more).

